  unitName: Medusa
  unitId: 60061
  unitNumber: 97
  description: A demon with snakes instead of hair. Humans who look into her eyes
    are cursed and turned to stone. Not only are they highly poisonous, the snakes
    on her head have high vitality and will live for a while even if cut from her
    head. Many soldiers have lost their lives to these snakes, making Medusa a dangerous
    demon even after she's been defeated.
  summonDesc: <br>Don't look at my eyes,<br>they'll turn you to stone!<br>I look
    forward to our journey!
  fusionDesc: Careful now.<br>You'll turn to stone if you <br>fall in love with me...
